<title>PHILIPPINES: Petron sets record date for stock div.</title>
<headline>Petron sets record date for stock div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine oil refiner Petron Corp on Tuesday set May 21 as the record date for its 20 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>In a disclosure to the Securities and Exchange Commission, Petron said the 20 percent stock dividend is equivalent to 1.5625 billion shares.</p>
<p>The dividend declaration will be presented to Petron shareholders for ratification at their annual meeting on April 21, the advisory said.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418939 fax 8176267</p>
